---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "JaniCrew is a locally owned commercial cleaning crew. Offices, restrooms, floors and carpets cleaned to a written standard. Free on-site quote in 5-10 minutes."
eyebrow: Commercial cleaning, locally owned
heading: Your local crew. Our standard of clean.
lede: "Offices, restrooms, floors and carpets, cleaned to a written room-by-room standard by a crew whose owner answers the phone. Free walkthrough and monthly estimate in 5-10 minutes."
heroImage: lobbyMopping
heroLabel: Crew member mopping a lobby
heroRatio: 16/9
heroTrust: true
bodyClass: page-home
---
{% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--row">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What we clean</p>
        <h2>Every room, spelled out.</h2>
        <p class="lede">No "general cleaning". Each area in your building gets a written checklist, and this is what's on it.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/services/">All services</a>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/service-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Industries we serve</p>
      <h2>Built around your building's rules.</h2>
      <p class="lede">A dental practice, a dealership and a school do not need the same scope. We write specifications around the regulations your industry works under.</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/industry-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--wide-text">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">How a free quote works</p>
      <h2>Ten minutes on site. No obligation.</h2>
      <p class="lede mb-6">You will not sit through a presentation. Your local JaniCrew owner walks the building with you and writes down the scope.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Call or send the form</h3>
          <p>Tell us what kind of building you have and which rooms matter most.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A 5-10 minute walkthrough</h3>
          <p>We walk the space with you and note the scope room by room. No hassle.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A monthly estimate in writing</h3>
          <p>A written scope and a monthly price for the schedule you choose.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top: var(--space-6)">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/quote/">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="media-with-burst">
      <a class="starburst" href="/quote/"><span>Free Quote</span></a>
      {% set img = images | slot("janitorialCart") %}
      {% set slotLabel = "Crew member emptying office bins" %}
      {% set ratio = "4/5" %}
      {% set eager = false %}
      {% include "partials/image-slot.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ standard.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ standard.title }}</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ standard.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/standard-strip.njk" %}
    <p style="margin: var(--space-6) 0 0"><a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/why-janicrew/">Read the full Standard</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      {% set img = images | slot("redPickup") %}
      {% set slotLabel = "Red JaniCrew pickup outside a client building" %}
      {% set ratio = "16/9" %}
      {% set eager = false %}
      {% include "partials/image-slot.njk" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ franchise.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ franchise.teaser.title }}</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ franchise.teaser.body }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/own-a-janicrew/">{{ franchise.teaser.cta }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
